# Storm, Windrider: "Creatures with flying can't attack you" (CR 508.1c) - "you" is Storm's controller alone. In a game of
# three Bot2 controls Storm; on turn 4 Bot1's Flying Men may not attack Bot2 but may attack Bot3, who takes 1.

